OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over 514-tonne load on M6,
OL,4,AM42, A42 and M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned to expect
OL,7,Fdelays on the M6, M42, A42 and M1 as an
OL,8,Fabnormal load is to be transported
OL,9,Falong the motorways.
OL,11,FThe 514-tonne electrical transformer
OL,12,Fwill leave Rugby, in Warwickshire, at
OL,13,F09:00 GMT on Saturday before arriving
OL,14,Fin Goole, in East Yorkshire.
OL,16,FNational Highways said the 81m (265 ft)
OL,17,Flong and 6.5m-wide vehicle will "fully
OL,18,Foccupy" the A42 in Leicestershire on
OL,19,FSaturday and will "not be passable".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
